WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.062 --> 00:00:04.344
Roxy was confused. "Where's the emergency?"

2
00:00:04.345 --> 00:00:08.916
Pam sighed. "There's no emergency."

3
00:00:08.917 --> 00:00:12.026
"What?" Roxy stamped her foot.

4
00:00:12.027 --> 00:00:14.789
"Why did you call the police?"

5
00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:19.330
Pam sighed. "We're sorry."

6
00:00:19.331 --> 00:00:23.527
Cam nodded. "Very sorry."

7
00:00:23.528 --> 00:00:26.453
"Huh?" Roxy scratched her head.

8
00:00:26.454 --> 00:00:30.783
"We'll never frame you again," Pam said.

9
00:00:30.784 --> 00:00:34.933
Cam crossed her heart. "We promise."

10
00:00:34.934 --> 00:00:36.521
Roxy frowned.

11
00:00:36.522 --> 00:00:41.009
"I'm still mad. But I accept your apology."

12
00:00:41.010 --> 00:00:48.703
Roxy left. Cam and Pam burst out laughing.

13
00:00:48.704 --> 00:00:54.809
"Our trap worked!" Pam said. "Rocket Girl came!"

14
00:00:54.810 --> 00:00:59.362
Cam nodded. "And she didn't spot that!"

15
00:00:59.363 --> 00:01:03.292
Cam pointed at a tiny video camera.

16
00:01:03.293 --> 00:01:05.494
Police knocked on the door.

17
00:01:05.495 --> 00:01:09.291
"There's no emergency here!" Pam said.

18
00:01:09.292 --> 00:01:11.018
She slammed the door.

19
00:01:11.019 --> 00:01:14.994
"Let's get to work!" Cam opened her laptop.

20
00:01:14.995 --> 00:01:16.833
She clicked on a video file.

21
00:01:16.834 --> 00:01:18.812
It was from the tiny camera.

22
00:01:18.813 --> 00:01:21.594
It showed the twins talking to Rocket Girl.

23
00:01:21.595 --> 00:01:24.124
Then she opened another video file.

24
00:01:24.125 --> 00:01:26.810
It showed the twins pretending to fight.

25
00:01:26.811 --> 00:01:28.857
The safe was behind them.

26
00:01:28.858 --> 00:01:34.936
Cam giggled. "Now I'll use my special video-editing software."

27
00:01:34.937 --> 00:01:36.864
She typed commands.

28
00:01:36.865 --> 00:01:39.829
"I remove myself from the fight video.

29
00:01:39.830 --> 00:01:45.104
Then I insert Rocket Girl."

30
00:01:45.105 --> 00:01:50.816
"It looks like I'm fighting Rocket Girl now," Pam said.

31
00:01:50.817 --> 00:01:55.321
"Now I add Rocket Girl's voice," Cam said.

32
00:01:55.322 --> 00:02:01.884
"It sounds just like her," Pam said.

33
00:02:01.885 --> 00:02:05.278
"Cam, you're a genius!"

34
00:02:05.279 --> 00:02:14.562
Cam smiled. "Hopefully this video will get lots of views!"

35
00:02:14.563 --> 00:02:17.395
Jack, Mara, and Terrell watched the new video.

36
00:02:17.396 --> 00:02:20.749
"Give me the money in the safe!" Rocket Girl yelled.

37
00:02:20.750 --> 00:02:24.013
"Never!" Pam punched and kicked.

38
00:02:24.014 --> 00:02:27.765
Finally Rocket Girl flew away.

39
00:02:27.766 --> 00:02:29.566
Pam looked into the camera.

40
00:02:29.567 --> 00:02:34.797
"There you go, folks! Rocket Girl tried to steal our money.

41
00:02:34.798 --> 00:02:37.915
Luckily I fought her off!"

42
00:02:37.916 --> 00:02:39.691
Cam's head popped into view.

43
00:02:39.692 --> 00:02:43.606
"Please click the Subscribe button!"

44
00:02:43.607 --> 00:02:45.648
Terrell bit his lip.

45
00:02:45.649 --> 00:02:47.844
"That was definitely fake.

46
00:02:47.845 --> 00:02:54.251
Nobody can fight off Rocket Girl."

47
00:02:54.252 --> 00:02:57.202
Roxy sat on a building.

48
00:02:57.203 --> 00:03:00.053
"I should go back to jail," she thought.

49
00:03:00.054 --> 00:03:03.362
"But Detective Smith and I are innocent."

50
00:03:03.363 --> 00:03:08.489
She stood up. "I'll go and tell Mayor Bloom."

51
00:03:08.490 --> 00:03:10.589
Roxy flew over the city.

52
00:03:10.590 --> 00:03:16.200
"Rocket Girl!" a man yelled.

53
00:03:16.201 --> 00:03:18.106
Roxy landed in the street.

54
00:03:18.107 --> 00:03:20.368
"Do you need help?" she asked.

55
00:03:20.369 --> 00:03:22.752
A crowd gathered around her.

56
00:03:22.753 --> 00:03:26.643
"The Tattle Twins posted a new video," a kid said.

57
00:03:26.644 --> 00:03:28.686
"You're a bad guy!"

58
00:03:28.687 --> 00:03:35.107
A woman frowned. "You tried to steal from those twins!"

59
00:03:35.108 --> 00:03:43.976
"Oh no!" Roxy groaned. "Pam and Cam tricked me!"

60
00:03:43.977 --> 00:03:47.386
Meanwhile three men also watched the new video.

61
00:03:47.387 --> 00:03:49.637
They looked mean and tough.

62
00:03:49.638 --> 00:03:51.809
One of them stroked his beard.

63
00:03:51.810 --> 00:04:01.898
"So . . . There's money in that safe, huh?"

